---
// A grid of hardware specs: <Specs><Spec icon="cpu" label="CPU">…</Spec>…</Specs>. Rules only, like tables.
---

<dl class="specs"><slot /></dl>

<style>
  .specs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 30rem) {
    .specs {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
